    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d600">

                <pb facs="1375" n="1261" sameAs="frus:frus1943/pg1261"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">
                    J.C.S. Files: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt and
                        Prime Minister Churchill to the Commander in Chief,
                        Allied Force Headquarters</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Eisenhower</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">operational priority</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-09-02">September 2, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>6704. From President Roosevelt and the Prime Minister to General Eisenhower,
                    personal and secret.</p>
                <p>Your 
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Naf</hi>
                     346,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d600-f1"/> 347,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d600-f2"
                    /> and 348.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d600-f3"/>
                </p>
                <p>We highly approve your decision to go on with 
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Avalanche</hi>
                     and to land an airborne division near Rome on the conditions indicated.
                    We <pb facs="1376" n="1262" xml:id="pg1262"/> fully recognize that military
                    consideration[s] must be dominant at this juncture.<anchor n="4"
                        xml:id="d600-f4"/>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d600-f1" n="1" xml:id="d600-f1-content">
